frac{∂}{∂y}(x - 3 y - 2 z)\\,j+\\frac{∂}{∂z}(x - 3 y - 2 z)\\,k \\\\  & =(1)\\,i+(-3)\\,j+(-2)\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute $x=t,y=t^{2},$ and $z=t$ into the above to find $∇f(r(t)):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(r(t)) & =(1)\\,i+(-3)\\,j+(-2)\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we calculate the derivative of $r(t),$ which is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t^{2})\\,j+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)\\,k \\\\  & =(1)\\,i+(2 t)\\,j+(1)\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, applying the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}[f(r(t))] & =∇f(r(t))\\cdot {r}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =((1)\\,i+(-3)\\,j+(-2)\\,k)\\cdot ((1)\\,i+(2 t)\\,j+(1)\\,k) \\\\  & =(1)\\cdot (1)+(-3)\\cdot (2 t)+(-2)\\cdot (1) \\\\  & =(1)+(- 6 t)+(-2) \\\\  & =- (6 t + 1).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["083c6ee8-7fc2-50bc-af5d-3d6b19fae25c"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "0ce4be0f-5d33-51bc-9050-760037179d6c" :answer/id #uuid "0ce4be0f-5d33-51bc-9050-760037179d6c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 8 \\left(t + 1\\right) e^{2} e^{2 t} \\sin{\\left(t^{2} + 2 t + 1 \\right)}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "55240750-0f78-5bc6-92b3-9cedb81aed12" :answer/id #uuid "55240750-0f78-5bc6-92b3-9cedb81aed12" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4 \\left(- \\sin{\\left(t^{2} + 2 t + 1 \\right)} + 2 \\cos{\\left(t^{2} + 2 t + 1 \\right)}\\right) e^{2} e^{2 t}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "97ca2dc3-593b-53d0-842f-e141944c8015" :answer/id #uuid "97ca2dc3-593b-53d0-842f-e141944c8015" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4 e \\left(- e e^{t} \\sin{\\left(t^{2} + 2 t + 1 \\right)} + 2 \\cos{\\left(t^{2} + 2 t + 1 \\right)}\\right) e^{t}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "357d82b0-b468-5bc5-b46c-2ef6c8defaa1" :answer/id #uuid "357d82b0-b468-5bc5-b46c-2ef6c8defaa1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/